<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakhstan auctions 600 mln tenge bills May 6.</title>
<headline>Kazakhstan auctions 600 mln tenge bills May 6.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan will auction 600 million tenge of three-month MKM discount Treasury bills on May 6, the National Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Full details of the issue:</p>
<p>    Series number		  KZ43K0708976</p>
<p>    Issue volume		   600 million tenge</p>
<p>    Tenor			    91 days</p>
<p>    Issue date		     May 6</p>
<p>    Maturity date		  Aug 7, 1997</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
